 {"type": "createTransportedUnit", "x": 0, "y": 6, "player": 1, "transportType": "Scorpion Tank", "transporterType": "Leviathan Barge"}, {"type": "createTransportedUnit", "x": 0, "y": 7, "player": 1, "transportType": "Scorpion Tank", "transporterType": "Leviathan Barge"}, {"type": "createTransportedUnit", "x": 1, "y": 7, "player": 1, "transportType": "Scorpion Tank", "transporterType": "Leviathan Barge"}, {"type": "createTransportedUnit", "x": 1, "y": 0, "player": 1, "transportType": "Stealth Tank", "transporterType": "Leviathan Barge"}, {"type": "createTransportedUnit", "x": 1, "y": 1, "player": 1, "transportType": "Stealth Tank", "transporterType": "Leviathan Barge"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "The War Machine is ready. Now we'll use the Federation's own weapon against them. It's a shame the Dragoons had to come all this way just to be dashed against the shore.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "I don't know how to swim.", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Then you'll just have to make sure your ship doesn't sink, won't you?", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "How nice of you to come greet our guests, Lieutenant.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Tucker. Of course. But it's not very polite of you to invite a guest over just so they can receive a severe beating.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "I don't recall inviting YOU anywhere.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "Oh snap!", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Man the ships, Major. I want you to storm across that water and seize these shores. I'm tired of hearing Tucker and his crony mock us in spite of their failures.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "MAJOR MAYJOR", "message": "So, those weren't dragons, those were Dragoons. I feel cheated.", "avatar": "mayjor", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "What was that strange unit?", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL USUL", "message": "That was the Jammer Truck.", "avatar": "usul", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Were you planning on joining this fight anytime soon, Dragoon?", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL USUL", "message": "Not before having a chance to study my enemy.", "avatar": "usul", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "And what have learned, watching from your little truck?", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL USUL", "message": "That you are skillful, aggressive and headstrong, just as Captain Tucker has said.", "avatar": "usul", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "You should leave here, Dragoon. There is nothing but destruction for you here.", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL USUL", "message": "Not so. We have come here for our vengeance.", "avatar": "usul", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Vengeance?! You started the Dragoon War with your raids on Akadia. We were allies!", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL USUL", "message": "How interesting. The victors truly do write the history books.", "avatar": "usul", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "And soon they will write about how the great Lieutenant Hayne drove the Dragoon menace from Akadian shores once and for all!", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL USUL", "message": "We will meet again, Lieutenant.", "avatar": "usul", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "LIEUTENANT HAYNE", "message": "Arrogant old man! We need to know what that Jammer Truck is capable of! Send out an infiltration team, I want a report of its capabilities immediately!", "avatar": "hayne", "color": "FF0000FF"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 2, "victory": false}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "scroll", "x": 16, "y": 1}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 16, "y": 1, "show": true}, {"type": "removeUnit", "x": 16, "y": 1, "fadeOut": true}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 16, "y": 1, "show": false}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}]}}